<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF says to auction 4-year notes on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF says to auction 4-year notes on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) is planning to hold an auction of four-year government notes on Tuesday, a ministry official said on Monday.</p>
<p>One trader said the ministry was likely to offer about 500 billion yen worth of notes with a coupon rate of 1.6 or 1.7 percent.</p>
</text>
